      "Header": {
        "value": "ট্রান্সপোজ ম্যাট্রিক্স (Transpose Matrix)",
        "order": 2
      },
      "Back Extra": {
        "value": "",
        "order": 3
      },
      "Comments": {
        "value": "Transpose matrix definition: swap rows and columns. Notation: $A^T$ or $A'$. If $A$ is $m \\times n$, $A^T$ is $n \\times m$. Properties: (i) $(A^T)^T = A$, (ii) $(A \\pm B)^T = A^T \\pm B^T$, (iii) $(AB)^T = B^T A^T$, (iv) $(kA)^T = kA^T$. Key testable: row-column interchange rule and matrix product reversal property.",
        "order": 4
      }
    },
    "modelName": "Image Occlusion",
