        "value": "Symmetric Matrix definition: Square matrix where transpose equals original matrix. Condition: $A^T = A$. Element property: $a_{ij} = a_{ji}$. Example: $A = [[1, 2, 5], [2, 3, 7], [5, 7, 4]]$. Testable: definition, condition formula, element index equality.",
        "order": 4
      }
