        "value": "<img src=\"paste-5326b3d842d1e36e655f80b1d1da346579c518f7.jpg\">",
        "order": 1
      },
      "Header": {
        "value": "বিপরীত ম্যাট্রিক্স (Inverse Matrix)",
        "order": 2
      },
      "Back Extra": {
        "value": "",
        "order": 3
      },
      "Comments": {
        "value": "Inverse matrix calculation for non-singular square matrices. Formula: $A^{-1} = \\frac{1}{|A|} \\text{Adj}(A)$. For $2 \\times 2$ matrix $A = \\begin{bmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{bmatrix}$, $A^{-1} = \\frac{1}{ad-bc} \\begin{bmatrix} d & -b \\\\ -c & a \\end{bmatrix}$. For $3 \\times 3$, $A^{-1} = \\frac{1}{|A|} [A_{ij}]^T$, where $A_{ij}$ are cofactors (সহগুণক). Testable: cofactor definitions, determinant condition $|A| \\neq 0$, and adjoint matrix transposition.",
        "order": 4
      }
    },
    "modelName": "Image Occlusion",
    "mod": 1789100341,
    "cards": [
      1760097988676
    ]
