        "value": "নির্ণায়কের প্রমাণ (Determinant Proof)",
        "order": 2
      },
      "Back Extra": {
        "value": "",
        "order": 3
      },
      "Comments": {
        "value": "Proof of determinant identity: $\\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ a & b & c \\\\ a^3 & b^3 & c^3 \\end{vmatrix} = (a-b)(b-c)(c-a)(a+b+c)$. Steps: (1) Apply column operations $C_1' = C_1 - C_2$ and $C_2' = C_2 - C_3$. (2) Factor out $(a-b)$ and $(b-c)$. (3) Expand remaining $2 \\times 2$ determinant. (4) Simplify quadratic terms using difference of squares/cubes. Testable: column operation logic and algebraic factorization.",
        "order": 4
      }
    },
    "modelName": "Image Occlusion",
    "mod": 1789100341,
